OL,3,GNEWSAFootball coming home for town with
OL,4,A#4m stadium plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club has been granted
OL,7,Fpermission to build a #4m stadium on
OL,8,Fthe ground it used to call home for
OL,9,Fmore than 100 years.
OL,11,FCouncillors approved Gorleston FC's
OL,12,Fplans to return to its traditional
OL,13,FRecreation Ground home in a project
OL,14,Fthat will see an artificial 3G pitch,
OL,15,Fspectator stand and clubhouse built.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
