OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFootball coming home for town with
OL,4,A#4m stadium plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrior to the decision by Great Yarmouth
OL,7,FBorough Council, the scheme had
OL,8,Fgarnered more than 500 letters of
OL,9,Fsupport - but there was also fierce
OL,10,Fopposition from locals who worried
OL,11,Fabout parking and the loss of access to
OL,12,Fthe ground.
OL,14,FCelebrating the news, the club said in
OL,15,Fa statement it was a "huge milestone"
OL,16,Ffor the team and wider community.
